\import{base-macros}

\p{The parent build lists \code{\verb~|rlvm-truffle~}, and a distribution built from published jars takes its jar like the machine's. The tier is still used only under the switch \code{\verb~|t2~}, which is off. The build of all modules with all tests, in a frozen copy of the tree: 16 modules, 1,409 tests, no failure, 18 opt-in tests skipped.}

\p{Detail: \src{rlvm-truffle/README.md}, [design-switches-document](design-switches-document). Commit \commit{6f02bb0}. Session: [machine speed and pipeline](ses-CVTE). Related: [the Truffle tier](design-truffle-tier).}
